    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why is everyone running away?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "Attack her with Arts! Stop running!!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "S-stop! She, she's coming this way! Stop her!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "Where are all the others?! Why...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You're the last one.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Aaaaah...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "Demon... S-someone save me...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "...You planned to stop me like this?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, I... No...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "You planned to stop me... like this?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Spare me! Please!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're not even worthy of being food for my Hannya.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Noooooo!!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.3
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "image": "bg_uptown_2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_015_lmg"
    },
    {
        "text": "Holy... We haven't even launched our attack yet.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L.G.D. Agent"
    },
    {
        "text": "She destroyed Reunion alone, in just two and a half minutes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L.G.D. Agent"
    },
    {
        "text": "She truly is a demon.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L.G.D. Agent"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "name2": "char_015_lmg",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Just be glad that you didn't meet her five years ago. It's been a long time since I last saw her fight like this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "What about the stragglers?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "name2": "char_015_lmg",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "They've already been captured by our various squads.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L.G.D. Agent"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Madam Ch'en, Inspector Hoshiguma seems to be waving at you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L.G.D. Agent"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.3
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_soldiersrun",
        "volume": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Medic, come with me!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "name2": "char_136_hsguma",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hoshiguma, what else did you ask those Reunion members?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "name2": "char_136_hsguma",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I asked them if the warehouse was rigged.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "name2": "char_136_hsguma",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "If the entire warehouse is hooked up with explosives...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "name2": "char_136_hsguma",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "We'll throw them in, one by one.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "name2": "char_136_hsguma",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "So?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "name2": "char_136_hsguma",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Nothing. Ah Faat made his way here after he was ambushed. Reunion originally was set up around here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ch'en, pull on the door's right side. I'll get the left.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 5,
        "ystrength": 3,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "name2": "char_136_hsguma",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...It seems to be jammed and won't budge. Let me try cutting a hole first.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "No need, I'll just tear it apart.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "(BOOOOM!)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 5,
        "ystrength": 3,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's open!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
