    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "image": "bg_storehouse"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "XR02, tell me your location! XR02!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "XR02!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Madam Ch'en... I hear fighting outside. The warehouse door... was busted open. It might be Reunion. I'll take care of it myself...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Informant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Stop, that's me! Don't hang up!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is that you, Madam Ch'en? That's a relief... I'm... all the way in the back.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Informant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.3
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "image",
        "image": "bg_5_3end1",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "imagetween",
        "xFrom": 0,
        "yFrom": 0,
        "xTo": 0,
        "yTo": 0,
        "xScaleFrom": 1,
        "yScaleFrom": 1,
        "xScaleTo": 1.15,
        "yScaleTo": 1.15,
        "duration": 15,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "That wound... what happened to your eyes?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "I wasn't careful enough, got hit by Arts. Don't worry about it, it doesn't matter now. This... *cough*... is for you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Informant"
    },
    {
        "text": "Medic, staunch his bleeding!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "No... Madam Ch'en, there's no need. I've already accepted...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Informant"
    },
    {
        "text": "Stop talking!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's true. Do you see how many times I've been shot? I'm blind, and don't want to move anymore. I've had enough of the pain. I'm so tired.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Informant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.3
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "image"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_013",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Take it, Madam Ch'en... S249TA, F106.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Informant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_013",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "49. I've memorized the location.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_013",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Details are on the paper. The intel about Reunion's infiltration was not sent to the other leaders, but just to one party... There must be a reason behind it. You must look into it, the sooner the better.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Informant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_013",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I will.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_013",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "*cough*... It was no easy task for me to get this... Anyway, Madam Ch'en, I didn't expect things to end up like this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Informant"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even though I was finally able to make a contribution, I didn't think this would be how I did it...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Informant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_013",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "None of us did. Thanks to your bravery, we now have a chance to stop the enemy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_013",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Haha... *cough*... I never liked Lungmen, and Lungmen never liked me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Informant"
    },
    {
        "text": "But now, I've finally managed to do something for Lungmen. Not bad for a bum like me, right...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Informant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_013",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You're calling one of the Chung Shui Big Three a bum?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_013",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Compared to you, Madam Oni, I'm nothing more than a bum.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Informant"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Informant"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Madam Ch'en, how's Madam Oni doing? Is she still working as Inspector?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Informant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_013",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "She is. She's been my partner for a long time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_013",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Madam Ch'en, Madam Oni... is too honest and frank. No one in the gang... *cough*... dared to challenge her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Informant"
    },
    {
        "text": "But she is no match for those Lungmen moguls. Please keep an eye on her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Informant"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't let anyone demean her. I won't let those stuck-up plutocrats insult her because of her background!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Informant"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is the only favor I ask of you. Just one... *cough* *cough*...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Informant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_013",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't worry about that. Hoshiguma is very strong. No one can hurt her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_013",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "No matter how powerful, everyone has their limits.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Informant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_013",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The entire L.G.D. stands with her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_013",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Good, that's a relief. Madam Oni, Madam Ch'en, I have no regrets now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Informant"
    },
    {
        "text": "Madam Ch'en, are you still here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Informant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_013",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I am.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_013",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Am I a good person?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Informant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_013",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "A few years ago, a bit hard to say. But now you are, without a doubt. Lungmen is proud of having citizens like you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_013",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hahaha... *cough*... Haha... a pathetic Infected can be a good citizen?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Informant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_013",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Some people in Lungmen are indeed obsessed with Oripathy, but you'd be better off asking Lungmen directly.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_013",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "How do I do that? Will a city answer me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Informant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_013",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Heh. I will, on its behalf.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "And it says, 'I don't mind.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah Faat, you have always been - and always will be - one of Lungmen's best.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_013",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Thank you, Madam Ch'en. Thank you so much.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Informant"
    },
    {
        "text": "Madam Chen, there are two things I'd like you to relay to Madam Oni.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Informant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_013",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You should tell her yourself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_013",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What do you mean? Are you saying...",
